WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.284
Sometimes the right event starts
with how you want people to feel.

00:00:03.688 --> 00:00:08.083
An unhurried brunch and a dance floor
at night call for very different rooms.

00:00:08.343 --> 00:00:10.225
For Mommy and Daddy Break Club,

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:13.384
a morning might move
from a quiet stretch to coffee,

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.011
brunch and a conversation
that actually has time to finish.

00:00:17.271 --> 00:00:20.994
For Retro Glam Session Night,
each edition picks one decade.

00:00:21.397 --> 00:00:23.196
The lighting, the DJ set

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.369
and the photo moments all
speak the same visual language.

00:00:26.629 --> 00:00:29.115
Our producers select
partners for catering,

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.975
décor, multimedia, staffing and logistics.

00:00:33.378 --> 00:00:34.821
We give each partner a cue,

00:00:35.247 --> 00:00:38.337
so guests can move naturally
from one moment to the next.

00:00:38.597 --> 00:00:41.962
Behind those choices is experience
from more than two hundred

00:00:41.976 --> 00:00:46.440
and fifty small and midsize events,
in addition to our corporate productions.

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:49.448
Explore the concept that feels
right for your group.

00:00:49.852 --> 00:00:51.363
Join its invitation list,

00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:54.755
or talk to us about bringing
a private edition to your guests.
